### Create Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Notebook Dell Inspiron",
  "description": "Notebook para uso profissional com processador Intel i7",
  "categoryIds": [
    "{{categoryId}}"
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("productId", response.body.id);
%}

###

### Create Product (multiple categories)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Monitor LG UltraWide",
  "description": "Monitor ultrawide 34 polegadas para produtividade",
  "categoryIds": [
    "{{categoryId}}",
    "{{categoryId2}}"
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("productId", response.body.id);
%}

###

### Create Product (without description)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teclado Mecânico",
  "description": "",
  "categoryIds": [
    "{{categoryId}}"
  ]
}

###

### Create Product (invalid - missing name)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Produto sem nome",
  "categoryIds": [
    "{{categoryId}}"
  ]
}

###

### Create Product (invalid - missing categories)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Produto sem categoria",
  "description": "Descrição",
  "categoryIds": []
}

